     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Different interests",
     "texto": [
      "A **licensing process** assesses whether a project can go ahead and under what conditions. A **participation process** gives affected groups the chance to express their opinion."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Weighing of interests",
     "texto": [
      "The development of hydroelectric power can provide more energy, but it can also affect nature and the local environment. A **weighing of interests** should make both benefits and costs visible."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
